-- W7/W9, #3185: an absent-key `Map` index through the REAL prelude `Map`.
-- `impl Index (Map k v) k v` raises `indexError` with an INTERPOLATED
-- message naming the key (via `debug`) since #3187/#3185 — this needs the
-- real prelude (MODULES corpus) to exercise `map.mdk`'s own impl, not a
-- stub. Both the native oracle and the WasmGC module must abort with EMPTY
-- stdout, the SAME `runtime error [E-INDEX-OOB]: key not found: "gamma"`
-- stderr line, and exit 1.
import map.{fromList}

main = println (fromList [("alpha", 1), ("beta", 2)])["gamma"]
